From: moto <j3tm0t0@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 21:05:47 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 52/53] mDNS: resolve .local names for TSP, answer as
 <hostname>.local

TSP RESOLVE and connect-by-name send a one-shot mDNS query (224.0.0.251:5353 from an ephemeral
port, so responders answer by unicast, RFC 6762 6.7) for names ending in .local; others go to
DNS as before. lwIP's mDNS responder answers for the board's hostname. TSP builds only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
